[CISA advisories] CISA Adds Four Known Exploited Vulnerabilities to Catalog — CISA has added four new vulnerabilities to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Catalog, based on evidence of active exploitation.&nbsp;

CVE-2026-102895 GPUStack Improper Authentication Vulnerability&nbsp;
CVE-2026-116779 SignalWire FreeSwitch Code Injection Vulnerability&nbsp;
CVE-2026-123158 OpenBSD OpenSSH Unexpected Status Code or Return Value Vulnerability&nbsp;
CVE-2026-123218 IBM Aspe
